Rule 6 (NumPy-compat variant: rcond as float with out; out shape/batch-compatible)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : float, v_3 : bool, v_4 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ ndim(v_4) = ndim(v_1) ∧ shape(v_4, -2) = shape(v_1, -1) ∧ shape(v_4, -1) = shape(v_1, -2) ∧ (if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_4, i) = shape(v_1, i)) ∧ (v_3 = true ∨ v_3 = false)
>>
